This product is built on the Android Open Source Project and uses gfxstream,
ANGLE and SQLite. Those works are not part of this repository and keep their
own licenses.

A built app contains an Android system image, gfxstream and ANGLE. The notices
of the graphics libraries are in ios/Licenses/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt, and each
release carries them, with the notices of the Android system image, inside the
app (Licenses/) and beside it.
